@AccountId = COLE_O_ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI
@TransactionId = COLE_O_TRANSACTION_ID_AQUI

### Accounts - criar conta
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Conta principal",
	"description": "Conta corrente",
	"currency": "BRL",
	"userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Accounts - saldo atual
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Accounts - transacoes do mes selecionado
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/transactions?month=7&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Accounts - todas as transacoes (sem filtro de periodo)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Accounts - resumo mensal
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/summary?month=9&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Accounts - evolucao dos ultimos seis meses
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/evolution?month=9&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Transactions - criar transacao
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"description": "Supermercado",
	"amount": 150.00,
	"category": "Alimentacao",
	"transactionDate": "2026-09-02T12:00:00Z",
	"type": 1,
	"accountId": "{{AccountId}}"
}

### Transactions - atualizar transacao
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/transactions/{{TransactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"description": "Supermercado atualizado",
	"amount": 175.00,
	"category": "Alimentacao",
	"transactionDate": "2026-09-02T12:00:00Z",
	"type": 1
}

### Transactions - excluir transacao
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/transactions/{{TransactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}

### Notifications - listar notificacoes
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Notifications - marcar notificacoes como lidas
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/Notifications/read
Authorization: Bearer {{AuthToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
	"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
]

